 "note": "Client-side fixture (t = fake monotonic clock, ms). While renew B (sent at 2000) is pending, a duplicate of the already consumed acquire reply is dropped and the deadline stays 15000; B's reply then gives 2000+15000 = 17000. The reply to the renew sent at 5000 arrives at t=17000 with no timer tick: the acknowledged deadline (17000) is reached (now >= deadline), so it is dropped. A replayed reply to an already consumed re is dropped. A repeat acquire sent at 31000 whose reply (ms_left 500) is applied at 31500 gives deadline = min(32000, 31000+500, auth) = 31500 = now, so control and input are off immediately (expiry is now >= deadline)."
